v->Each(\(IntRef) ~ Nil : (n) => n->PrintLine());
```
		~#
		method : public : Each(f : (H) ~ Nil) ~ CompareVector<H> {
			for(i : Int := 0; i < @size; i += 1;) {
				f(@values[i]);
			};
			return @self;
		}

		#~
		Adds a value to the end
		@param value value to append

```
