mmap->IsEmpty()->PrintLine(); # true
mmap->Insert("a", IntRef->New(1));
mmap->IsEmpty()->PrintLine(); # false
```
		~#
		method : public : IsEmpty() ~ Bool {
			return @map->Size() = 0;
		}

		#~
		Clears the map

```
